---
import '@fontsource/poppins/400.css';
import '@fontsource/playfair-display/400-italic.css';
import Logo from '../components/Logo.astro';
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Página no encontrada · Lara Hair Club</title><meta name="robots" content="noindex" /><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
<style is:global>
body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#1F3D31;color:#FAF6EC;font-family:Poppins,system-ui,sans-serif;text-align:center;padding:24px;box-sizing:border-box}
.lg{width:170px;margin:0 auto 28px;color:#E3C77E}.lg svg{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}.lg svg *{fill:#E3C77E}
h1{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;font-size:clamp(30px,6vw,44px);margin:0 0 12px}
p{opacity:.85;margin:0 0 28px}
a{display:inline-block;background:#C9A24E;color:#132A21;text-decoration:none;padding:14px 28px;border-radius:999px;font-weight:500}
</style></head>
<body><main><div class="lg"><Logo /></div><h1>Esta página no existe</h1><p>Pero tu próximo rubio sí. Vuelve al inicio para conocernos.</p><a href="/">Ir al inicio</a></main></body></html>
